   "source": [
    "# FinanceAI — EDA del Dataset Híbrido\n",
    "**Team 38 (LATAM) · Oracle ONE G9**\n",
    "\n",
    "Este notebook construye (o carga) el dataset híbrido (Capa 1: transacciones reales + Capa 2: perfil financiero sintético) y realiza un análisis exploratorio (EDA) inicial para el Sprint 1.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Cómo usar en Google Colab o local:**\n",
    "1. Si vas a usar Colab, sube tu `kaggle.json` o los CSV crudos a `data/raw/`.\n",
    "2. Ejecuta la celda de instalación de dependencias.\n",
    "3. Ejecuta la celda de "Construir dataset" para invocar el pipeline refactorizado (`src.data.build_dataset_financeai`).\n",
    "\n",
    "> Observación: la lógica de construcción del dataset fue extraída a `src/data/build_dataset_financeai.py`. El notebook ahora invoca ese script para mayor reproducibilidad y testabilidad.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 1. Configuración del entorno\n"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Instalación de dependencias (Colab ya trae pandas/numpy/matplotlib/seaborn)\n",
    "!pip install -q kaggle faker\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\")\n",
    "RANDOM_SEED = 42\n",
    "np.random.seed(RANDOM_SEED)\n",
    "\n",
    "RAW_DIR = Path(\"data/raw\")\n",
    "PROCESSED_DIR = Path(\"data/processed\")\n",
    "RAW_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "PROCESSED_DIR.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "CATEGORIAS_PROYECTO = [\n",
    "    \"Alimentación\", \"Transporte\", \"Salud\", \"Vivienda\",\n",
    "    \"Educación\", \"Ocio\", \"Servicios\", \"Otros\",\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Entorno configurado.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 2. Construir el dataset híbrido (llama al pipeline refactorizado)\n"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Esta celda invoca el pipeline refactorizado `src.data.build_dataset_financeai`\n",
    "# Si prefieres, puedes ejecutar el script localmente en tu máquina en lugar de desde el notebook.\n",
    "\n",
    "RUTA_CAPA1 = RAW_DIR / \"financial_transactions.csv\"\n",
    "RUTA_CAPA2 = RAW_DIR / \"personal_finance_ml.csv\"\n",
    "\n",
    "if RUTA_CAPA1.exists() and RUTA_CAPA2.exists():\n",
    "    print(\"Archivos crudos encontrados: ejecutando pipeline...\")\n",
    "    cmd = [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"src.data.build_dataset_financeai\",\n",
    "           \"--raw-dir\", str(RAW_DIR), \"--processed-dir\", str(PROCESSED_DIR),\n",
    "           \"--n-users\", \"500\", \"--seed\", str(RANDOM_SEED)]\n",
    "    result = subprocess.run(cmd)\n",
    "    if result.returncode == 0:\n",
    "        print(\"Pipeline ejecutado correctamente.\")\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(\"El pipeline devolvió código de error:\", result.returncode)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"No se encontraron los CSV crudos en data/raw/.\")\n",
    "    print(\"Sube los archivos (financial_transactions.csv y personal_finance_ml.csv) a data/raw/ o ejecuta el script localmente.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 3. Cargar dataset final\n"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ruta_final = PROCESSED_DIR / \"financeai_dataset_hibrido.csv\"\n",
    "if ruta_final.exists():\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(ruta_final)\n",
    "    print(f\"Dataset cargado: {df.shape[0]} usuarios, {df.shape[1]} columnas\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"No se encontró el dataset procesado. Ejecuta el pipeline o sube el CSV a data/processed/.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Muestra una vista previa si existe\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    df.head()\n",
    "except NameError:\n",
    "    pass\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 4. Panorama general (EDA) — checks rápidos\n"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Ejecuta estas comprobaciones si `df` está cargado\n",
    "if 'df' in globals():\n",
    "    print(\"Dimensiones:\", df.shape)\n",
    "    print()\n",
    "    print(\"Tipos de dato:\")\n",
    "    print(df.dtypes)\n",
    "    print()\n",
    "    print(\"Estadística descriptiva (numérica):\")\n",
    "    print(df.describe(include='number').T)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Carga el dataset procesado para ejecutar el EDA.\")\n"
   ]
  }
